  "details": "LaraDashboard before 1.4.8 contains an open redirect vulnerability that allows remote attackers to redirect users by supplying an unvalidated redirect_url parameter to EmailTemplateController builder and builderEdit. Attackers can send crafted builder links to logged-in users with email template permissions so saving a template navigates them to attacker-controlled phishing sites.",
